flowchart LR
    A[Receive invoice] --> B[Log invoice details]
    B --> C{Required details<br/>complete?}
    C -- No --> D[Request missing information]
    D --> B
    C -- Yes --> E[Check for possible duplicate]
    E --> F{Needs review<br/>or approval?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Route to responsible approver]
    G --> H{Approved?}
    H -- No --> I[Record hold or rejection reason]
    H -- Yes --> J[Show approved item by due date]
    F -- No --> J
    J --> K[Record payment status]
    K --> L[Review open and overdue items]
